Title = "Grass and foliage"
Note = "Leaves, grass, bushes: mostly cut-out textures (the alpha comes from the texture and its classic material). No parallax, soft normals, a little sheen. Tuned on Luca and Baaj leaves, Luca grass, the Mi'ihen tree. Backlight (the leaves' own colour through them) and subsurface scattering are on."
